209
00:08:43,060 --> 00:08:43,740
Yes.

210
00:08:43,740 --> 00:08:45,660
But it's not the only way to kill me.

211
00:08:45,660 --> 00:08:47,020
There's lots of ways to kill me.

212
00:08:47,020 --> 00:08:49,340
You could stone me to death by electrifying me.

213
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:50,260
There's tons of stuff.

214
00:08:50,260 --> 00:08:52,680
Hopefully, you're not planning on doing any of this stuff.

215
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:54,580
But there's lots of ways of doing it.

216
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:55,260
All right.

217
00:08:55,260 --> 00:08:58,860
Now, in general, in mathematics, and especially

218
00:08:58,860 --> 00:09:02,700
